---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="Xiao Nan / Shawn on applied AI, reliable and scalable agentic workflows, and a professional focus on technology and finance." includePerson>
  <header class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">A brief introduction</p><h1>Hi, I’m {site.name}.<br />Also {site.alternateName}.</h1></header>
  <div class="about-copy">
    <p>My current focus is applied AI and agentic workflows: how to make AI agents, and the systems around them, more reliable and scalable.</p>
    <p>Technology and finance remain my professional focus. I’m interested in how AI can be applied in these domains, and what it takes for those applications to work dependably as their use grows.</p>
    <h2>What I’m thinking about</h2>
    <p>Reliability and scale are the questions I keep coming back to. This site is a place to share writing and, over time, specific contributions and lessons from my work.</p>
    <h2>Elsewhere</h2>
    <p>I’d like to connect with peers and collaborators exploring applied AI and agentic workflows. You can find me here:</p>
    {site.profiles.map(({ label, href }) => <p><a href={href}>{label} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p>)}
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
